      <div className="pointer-events-none absolute left-1/2 top-2 z-[750] -translate-x-1/2 rounded bg-[#070B12]/70 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-wider text-cyan-300/90 backdrop-blur-sm">
        ŞİMAL
